---
# ext-scarpe, ledger N1: Scarpe draws its own controls, so it tells a screen reader what they are.
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: N1
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  button "Save", tooltip: "Writes the file"
end
----------- test code
node = a11y_nodes.find { |n| n[:role] == "button" }
assert_equal "Writes the file", node[:description], "read after the name"
